      Bump the v2.1.3 entry below to v2.1.4+Sparkle on the very
      first Sparkle-aware release — that's the build users have
      to install manually, and from then on everything updates
      automatically.
    -->
    <item>
      <title>Version 2.1.3</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 17:41:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>2.1.3</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.1.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <p>Reverts the broken v2.1.2 deny-by-default Finder filter and restores normal behavior.</p>
        <p>Includes the v2.1.1-line fixes: versioned-bucket delete, instant Finder reflection of create/delete.</p>
      ]]></description>
      <!--
        v2.1.3 was shipped before Sparkle was integrated — it has no
        SUPublicEDKey embedded, so it can't validate updates. Users on
        v2.1.3 will need ONE manual update to a Sparkle-aware build
        (v2.1.4+); after that, every future update arrives automatically.
        Enclosure is here for completeness but won't be used by Sparkle.
      -->
      <enclosure
        url="https://github.com/fraggleglam/spacetime-drive/releases/download/v2.1.3/SpaceTimeDrive.pkg"
        length="12295054"
        type="application/octet-stream" />
